module test.claim.altra_autoinstall_seed_witness

// WITNESSES FOR THE Altra autoinstall SEED and its BINDING (gunbc.provisioning.altra_autoinstall_seed).
// Each test names the failure it exists to catch, and every one of them goes RED when the invariant it
// guards is inverted — the required CI jobs do not evaluate witnesses, so this file is the only gate those
// invariants have. The two that matter most are named in their own comments: the disk rule's two halves
// (zero-match and multi-match refusals are different arms caught by different tests, because the worst
// thing this cut can do is install onto the wrong disk of an 8-bay board) and the credential posture
// (a headless box nobody can log into must be unrepresentable as valid).

